  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC phase-out management plan (stage I, second tranche)_Grenada</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNIDO is implementing the investment component of the HCFC Phase-out Management Plan of Grenada The activities for Stage I of the investment component include 1. Procurement of Refrigeration and Air-conditioning Service Equipment (i) Conduct a needs assessment (ii) Procure Equipment 2. Good AC Design for large facilities and for Technicians in the design of AC systems (i) Engage a consultant to develop and deliver the modules (ii)          Conduct 4 Seminars on Good AC Design for large facilities and for Technicians in the design of AC systems 3. Demonstration Project for Conversion of HCFC Equipment already installed (i) Engage a Consultant (ii)          Procure specific equipment and materials (iii)        Conduct monitoring of project</narrative>
  </description>
